    "summary": "In [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), whenever a model of this unit is **destroyed** before the unit has been **selected to fight** in that phase, roll a D6, with +1 to the roll if the destroyed model was in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of an enemy unit whose T is at least as high as this unit's. On a 4+, that model stays on the battlefield until the phase ends or this unit has fought, whichever comes first, and is then removed.",
